# Billo Bazaar settings. Copy this file to .env.local (on your computer) or add the same names
# in your host's settings (online, e.g. Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables).
# Never put real passwords in this file: it is on GitHub.

# ---- Admin panel (/admin) ----
ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
ADMIN_PASSWORD=choose-a-long-password

# ---- Email sending from the admin panel ----
# Any SMTP email service works. Leave these out and emails are saved in the admin panel, not sent.
#
# SETUP with Gmail:
#   1. Turn on 2-Step Verification for the Google account.
#   2. Google account > Security > App passwords > create one (16 letters).
#   3. Fill in:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=the-16-letter-app-password
# MAIL_FROM=Billo Bazaar <you@gmail.com>
#
# With your own domain (e.g. hello@billobazaar.pk), a service like Resend or Brevo gives you
# SMTP details to use in the same five settings.

# ---- Database ----
# On your computer the database is the file data/billobazaar.db (made automatically).
# Online, the site needs a database that lasts: create a free one at turso.tech and add:
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-database.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-token
